# Environment Variables for Family Recipe Manager

# ============================================
# LOCAL DEVELOPMENT (SQLite)
# ============================================
# For local development, use a file-based SQLite database
DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db"

# ============================================
# PRODUCTION (Turso - LibSQL)
# ============================================
# These should be set in Vercel dashboard for production deployment
# DO NOT set these in your local .env file unless testing Turso connection

# Your Turso database URL (format: libsql://[database-name].turso.io)
# TURSO_DATABASE_URL="libsql://your-database.turso.io"

# Your Turso authentication token
# TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN="your-auth-token-here"

# ============================================
# HOW IT WORKS
# ============================================
# The Prisma client in app/lib/prisma.js automatically detects the environment:
# - If DATABASE_URL starts with "file:", uses local SQLite
# - Otherwise, uses TURSO_DATABASE_URL and TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN for Turso/LibSQL
#
# This means:
# - Local dev: Only set DATABASE_URL
# - Production (Vercel): Only set TURSO_DATABASE_URL and TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN




